# What changes a hit's damage and its message, with violence_update on: each fight gets a round or so, then
# Smokegod (60) makes peace, and slays the mob if it's no longer needed. In the temple (3001), with Hassan:
# - Decimus (10), with a sword whose attack is divine power, against a septon (9006), immune to holy: "unaffected"
# - Yeoman (5), with a dagger (pierce), and Rambler (2), with a club (pound), against a pet dragon (350), whose
#   sanctuary halves damage, and which is vulnerable to pierce and resists bash
# - Clansman (20), made evil, against Captain Jacklyn (603), protected from evil
# - Unseen (5, invisible) attacks a duck and fades into existence; Seer (20) attacks a sleeping duck (double damage)
#   and a resting one
# - a duck attacks Sot (10, drunk: a drunk victim takes 9/10)
# - the septon attacks Rambler, whose wimpy (14) makes them flee
# - a fido attacks Yeoman's charmed duck, after Smokegod has moved Yeoman away: it flees
@updates area,violence
@connect god
Smokegod
smoke123
@return
@return
@connect dec
Decimus
psswrd
@return
@return
@connect yeo
Yeoman
psswrd
@return
@return
